<break time="600ms"/>
one thing i’m still working on is…
<break time="600ms"/>
my self-care contract fill this out as a commitment to yourself:
<break time="600ms"/>
when i feel guilt, i will…
<break time="600ms"/>
when i feel anger, i will…
<break time="600ms"/>
when i feel drained, i will…
<break time="600ms"/>
when i need joy, i will…
<break time="600ms"/>
my go-to grounding practice is…
<break time="600ms"/>
vision for my future self close your eyes. imagine your life healed: guilt lighter, anger expressed, boundaries strong, joy restored. then write:
<break time="600ms"/>
my relationships look like…
<break time="600ms"/>
my body feels like…
<break time="600ms"/>
my daily rhythm includes…
<break time="600ms"/>
my inner child finally feels…
<break time="600ms"/>
what would your life look like if your guilt was lighter and your joy restored what would you say to the you who opens this book one year from now.
<break time="600ms"/>
